1
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:14,431
[Anzu] It's you!

2
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:18,268
-The devil!
-You're wrong!

3
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:19,936
No devil. Riri.

4
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,187
-[Tsukasa] Hoshino.
-[gasps]

5
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:24,024
Huh…

6
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:28,027
[screams]

7
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:31,573
What are you two-- Why are you--
How long were you both there?

8
00:00:31,656 --> 00:00:34,159
I'm sorry, I wasn't trying to eavesdrop.

9
00:00:34,659 --> 00:00:36,578
-I fully was.
-Dude.

10
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:39,873
[Tsukasa] I saw you following those two.

11
00:00:41,958 --> 00:00:45,712
I was just gonna step in
if it started to get bad.

12
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:46,796
But, um, I…

13
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:50,842
-I never really found the right time to.
-[Anzu grunts]

14
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:54,345
[Riri] You can tell me. I get it.
I'm so conscious about mine, too.

15
00:00:54,429 --> 00:00:56,848
But with yours, you worked magic,

16
00:00:56,931 --> 00:00:59,809
they look like a full C cup,
not like Anzu's at all.

17
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:04,147
I'm so jealous of your push-up C cup.
C cup, C cup, C cup…

18
00:01:04,814 --> 00:01:06,316
C cup!

19
00:01:06,399 --> 00:01:08,276
[Riri screams]
Oh, my God!

20
00:01:08,943 --> 00:01:10,236
That's too high.

21
00:01:11,154 --> 00:01:12,614
[Tsukasa] Sorry about all that.

22
00:01:12,697 --> 00:01:15,825
Huh? Wait, what? Oh, it's not a big deal.

23
00:01:16,326 --> 00:01:17,160
[Tsukasa] And…

24
00:01:17,869 --> 00:01:18,787
Hm.

25
00:01:19,454 --> 00:01:21,372
Well, thank you again.

26
00:01:22,415 --> 00:01:25,835
Kazuki told me
he is not looking to date right now.

27
00:01:26,711 --> 00:01:29,839
Out of respect for my friend,
I can't help.

28
00:01:31,424 --> 00:01:32,342
Huh?

29
00:01:33,885 --> 00:01:35,678
[grunts, giggles]

30
00:01:35,762 --> 00:01:36,930
[grunts]
What do you mean?

31
00:01:37,472 --> 00:01:41,392
All that C cup talk
completely distracted you.

32
00:01:41,976 --> 00:01:45,396
Anzu, is… is this girl here
a friend from your class?

33
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,524
[gasps]
It's nice to meet you!

34
00:01:47,607 --> 00:01:50,693
-I am Riri Fushigi, Anzu's cousin.
-[groans]

35
00:01:50,777 --> 00:01:51,611
[chuckles]

36
00:01:51,694 --> 00:01:53,613
-Cousin?
-That's right.

37
00:01:53,696 --> 00:01:57,242
Oh, Anzu told me so much
about both of you guys.

38
00:01:57,325 --> 00:01:59,077
You are her temp roomie, Kazuki.

39
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,913
And you're her old friend, Junta.
Is that right?

40
00:02:02,580 --> 00:02:05,083
Now, let's all head home together.

41
00:02:05,166 --> 00:02:06,084
Huh?

42
00:02:06,167 --> 00:02:08,419
[Riri] Talk about fate,
us all meeting like this.

43
00:02:08,503 --> 00:02:11,005
Hey, the four of us
should totally have a dinner party.

44
00:02:11,089 --> 00:02:12,799
At Anzu's place, of course.

45
00:02:12,882 --> 00:02:14,551
[Anzu] She's not gonna stop.

46
00:02:14,634 --> 00:02:17,220
You don't have to work tonight, right?

47
00:02:17,303 --> 00:02:18,471
Uh, yeah.

48
00:02:18,972 --> 00:02:21,599
And, Junta, you don't have
baseball practice, right?

49
00:02:21,683 --> 00:02:22,684
Right.

50
00:02:22,767 --> 00:02:24,769
Then let's hurry home!

51
00:02:24,853 --> 00:02:26,020
-[chuckles]
-[grunts]

52
00:02:26,104 --> 00:02:27,939
Come on, I'm starving.

53
00:02:28,022 --> 00:02:28,940
[Anzu] Huh, huh…

54
00:02:29,023 --> 00:02:31,401
-Hooray! Let's go!
-Hey! Wait!

55
00:02:31,484 --> 00:02:32,777
BULLDOZING HER WAY THROUGH

56
00:02:32,861 --> 00:02:35,864
[Anzu] Your magic's been
a whole lot of trouble,

57
00:02:35,947 --> 00:02:38,241
but you're way
more trouble to me in flesh and blood.

58
00:02:38,324 --> 00:02:39,993
[Riri giggles]

59
00:02:45,832 --> 00:02:47,834
[theme music]

60
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:15,213
[Anzu] That's right.
In order to save Junta,

61
00:04:15,296 --> 00:04:17,298
who's unfortunately in love with me,

62
00:04:17,882 --> 00:04:19,384
just because of that devil,

63
00:04:19,467 --> 00:04:23,888
and for my own sake as well,
I've gotta crush those feels!

64
00:04:23,972 --> 00:04:26,474
So let's tuck in that shirt.

65
00:04:27,058 --> 00:04:29,477
-No, not today!
-[yells]

66
00:04:30,687 --> 00:04:32,021
[groans]

67
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:35,400
-Riri! When did you…
-[gasps]

68
00:04:35,984 --> 00:04:38,403
[shrieks]
I'm so happy!

69
00:04:38,486 --> 00:04:41,906
You called me by my real name
for the very first time.

70
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:44,075
I don't care about all that.

71
00:04:44,158 --> 00:04:47,287
When did you decide to take human shape?

72
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:50,415
What happened to
your way less cute body, huh?

73
00:04:50,498 --> 00:04:52,458
-[Riri] I'm here for support.
-Huh?

74
00:04:53,042 --> 00:04:57,213
[Riri] Anzu, you're destroying
your chance of getting close to Junta,

75
00:04:57,297 --> 00:05:00,466
your second personally selected
hot potential boyfriend.

76
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:05,430
That's why I thought I would step it up
and help you in person!

77
00:05:06,014 --> 00:05:07,432
And with my support,

78
00:05:07,515 --> 00:05:10,935
your two-hottie dinner party
will be super successful.

79
00:05:11,019 --> 00:05:14,272
So now, go change into
a cuter, more girly outfit!

80
00:05:14,355 --> 00:05:16,816
And don't part your hair like that.

81
00:05:16,899 --> 00:05:19,652
Shut up! I look just fine like this!

82
00:05:19,736 --> 00:05:23,114
No way. You look lame like that.
They'll be totally turned off.

83
00:05:23,197 --> 00:05:24,115
[Anzu grunts]

84
00:05:24,824 --> 00:05:26,117
[both grunt]

85
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:29,078
-Let's try a little harder! Huh?
-[Anzu grunts]

86
00:05:29,162 --> 00:05:31,581
It's fine if they are turned off.

87
00:05:32,457 --> 00:05:33,416
[Riri scoffs]

88
00:05:33,499 --> 00:05:35,501
[suspenseful music]

89
00:05:37,628 --> 00:05:39,047
[groans]

90
00:05:42,216 --> 00:05:43,051
[Riri] Open.

91
00:05:43,634 --> 00:05:44,761
[Anzu screams]

92
00:05:44,844 --> 00:05:46,179
-[thuds]
-[Anzu] Ow!

93
00:05:46,846 --> 00:05:48,931
-[groans]
-[Tsukasa] Hm…

94
00:05:49,015 --> 00:05:49,849
Huh?

95
00:05:51,350 --> 00:05:52,769
-[gasps]
-[grunts]

96
00:05:52,852 --> 00:05:55,855
[Anzu] Our roles
have been reversed once again.

97
00:05:56,731 --> 00:05:58,399
[breathes nervously]

98
00:05:58,483 --> 00:05:59,442
[grunts]

99
00:06:00,443 --> 00:06:01,652
[in deep voice]
Sorry.

100
00:06:01,736 --> 00:06:02,945
[sighs]

101
00:06:04,906 --> 00:06:08,576
I feel like weird stuff happens
when I'm with you.

102
00:06:08,659 --> 00:06:09,660
Sorry.

103
00:06:09,744 --> 00:06:10,870
[chuckles awkwardly]

104
00:06:10,953 --> 00:06:12,663
-[laughs]
-[groans]

105
00:06:13,790 --> 00:06:15,166
[evil laughter]

106
00:06:15,249 --> 00:06:18,544
[Anzu] You jerk!
That was all part of your scheme.

107
00:06:19,128 --> 00:06:20,171
[doorbell dings]

108
00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:22,465
Thanks for the invite.

109
00:06:22,965 --> 00:06:25,176
Here, my mom made karaage.

110
00:06:25,259 --> 00:06:27,512
Wow, thank you!

111
00:06:28,262 --> 00:06:31,474
-[Anzu] Karaage! Karaage! Karaage!
-Is that curry?

112
00:06:31,557 --> 00:06:33,059
-Karaage!
-Smells good!

113
00:06:33,142 --> 00:06:36,646
-Yep! Kazuki is making it right now.
-[soft chuckle]

114
00:06:38,106 --> 00:06:40,108
-[all] Let's eat!
-[Riri giggles]

115
00:06:40,733 --> 00:06:42,735
[cheerful music]

116
00:06:44,737 --> 00:06:46,656
[moans in delight]

117
00:06:46,739 --> 00:06:49,242
-So good!
-[Riri munching]

118
00:06:49,325 --> 00:06:50,326
What's in it?

119
00:06:50,827 --> 00:06:52,745
I added asparagus juice.

120
00:06:52,829 --> 00:06:54,747
Mm… amazing!

121
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:57,333
I think it's even better
than my mom's curry.

122
00:06:57,416 --> 00:06:59,544
Hey, Junta, isn't it tasty?

123
00:06:59,627 --> 00:07:00,461
Yeah.

124
00:07:02,004 --> 00:07:02,880
[sighs]

125
00:07:03,798 --> 00:07:07,677
[Junta] He's good-looking,
he's smart, and he's a great cook.

126
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,887
I'm totally losing to him.

127
00:07:11,097 --> 00:07:14,767
[Riri] Junta seems to be unaware
of his own awesome qualities.

128
00:07:19,605 --> 00:07:20,690
More, please.

129
00:07:20,773 --> 00:07:21,899
-Really?
-[Riri moans happily]

130
00:07:21,983 --> 00:07:23,109
Sure. Go on and get some.

131
00:07:23,192 --> 00:07:24,527
How much can I take?

132
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,737
Help yourself. I made plenty for us.

133
00:07:27,238 --> 00:07:30,658
Oh, you did, huh?
Then, I might have seconds too.

134
00:07:30,741 --> 00:07:32,535
-[Tsukasa] Aren't you on a diet?
-Huh?

135
00:07:33,286 --> 00:07:36,956
Huh? Anzu, you're on a diet? But why?

136
00:07:38,374 --> 00:07:43,004
Well, I… I am… just chocolate.
I'm trying to cut back on it a bit.

137
00:07:43,087 --> 00:07:45,590
Your favorite video games,
chocolate, your cat.

138
00:07:45,673 --> 00:07:49,469
Your three greatest desires
have all been confiscated by yours truly.

139
00:07:49,552 --> 00:07:51,762
But it's so yummy. Mm.

140
00:07:51,846 --> 00:07:53,473
[Anzu] I know you confiscated it.

141
00:07:53,556 --> 00:07:57,059
You would even eat tons of chocolate
when you had cavities and it made you cry.

142
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,395
Did that even really happen?

143
00:07:59,479 --> 00:08:00,521
[laughs awkwardly]

144
00:08:00,605 --> 00:08:02,523
I'm going for seconds. Yah.

145
00:08:02,607 --> 00:08:03,649
[Tsukasa] Go for it.

146
00:08:04,525 --> 00:08:09,655
Kazuki, you're really helping Anzu out
by cooking and being so responsible.

147
00:08:09,739 --> 00:08:10,573
[Junta gasps]

148
00:08:10,656 --> 00:08:14,160
[Riri] Why don't you have him
stay for longer than a month?

149
00:08:14,243 --> 00:08:15,077
What?

150
00:08:15,161 --> 00:08:19,040
[Riri] It's stressful and dangerous
for a girl to have to live all by herself.

151
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:22,668
Riri, what are you saying?

152
00:08:22,752 --> 00:08:25,796
That would be a pain
in the butt for Kazuki.

153
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,381
[Riri] Why would it be?

154
00:08:27,465 --> 00:08:31,093
It would be easier on him,
financially too.

155
00:08:31,844 --> 00:08:32,887
[Anzu grunts]

156
00:08:34,805 --> 00:08:36,766
[Anzu] Shut up, you…

157
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,771
No, that would be
way too much to ask of her.

158
00:08:42,438 --> 00:08:43,397
[Junta exhales deeply]

159
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:48,069
[Anzu] I'm so glad
that Kazuki's got common sense.

160
00:08:48,569 --> 00:08:50,655
[scoffs]
It serves you right,

161
00:08:50,738 --> 00:08:52,198
you stupid, idiot devil.

162
00:08:52,281 --> 00:08:55,785
I'm sure you're worried
about Anzu too, right Junta?

163
00:08:55,868 --> 00:08:57,703
I know. There's another empty room.

164
00:08:57,787 --> 00:08:59,497
[Riri] Why don't you live with her too?

165
00:08:59,580 --> 00:09:00,498
Huh?

166
00:09:00,581 --> 00:09:04,502
[Anzu] Someone shut her up!
It's about to be a total chaos over here!

167
00:09:05,211 --> 00:09:08,506
I think I'm in the mood
for some ice cream now.

168
00:09:08,589 --> 00:09:10,091
-What? That's random!
-Hey!

169
00:09:10,174 --> 00:09:13,469
Rock-paper-scissors,
and the two losers go get it.

170
00:09:13,553 --> 00:09:15,805
I'm sorry, what is that now? Hm?

171
00:09:17,306 --> 00:09:18,808
Hey, wait, that wand…

172
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:22,853
That's how she casts her magic.

173
00:09:25,273 --> 00:09:26,732
-[Anzu] Riri!
-Uh-huh?

174
00:09:29,777 --> 00:09:32,071
-There's a fly.
-[explosion]

175
00:09:32,154 --> 00:09:34,865
-[Riri groaning]
-Never mind. It was just some gunk.

176
00:09:34,949 --> 00:09:37,910
Oh, Anzu, you're such a meanie sometimes.

177
00:09:40,621 --> 00:09:41,455
[gasps]

178
00:09:41,998 --> 00:09:44,417
-[chuckles]
-Anzu, my-- my wand…

179
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:48,087
[Anzu] You can't use your magic
without this wand, can you?

180
00:09:48,170 --> 00:09:50,715
I'm sure your intention
was to manipulate the game

181
00:09:50,798 --> 00:09:55,595
so that I would end up hanging out alone
with either Kazuki or Junta.

182
00:09:55,678 --> 00:09:59,473
But I won't let you.
You pushed your luck too far!

183
00:10:00,057 --> 00:10:02,602
Anyway, shouldn't the one
who's in the mood

184
00:10:02,685 --> 00:10:05,479
for ice cream be the one to go get it?

185
00:10:05,563 --> 00:10:07,857
That way, you can pick the ones you want.

186
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:13,112
Oh, fine, I'll go with you
since you want it that bad!

187
00:10:13,696 --> 00:10:15,615
-All right, let's go.
-[Riri grunts]

188
00:10:16,198 --> 00:10:17,950
-[door opens, closes]
-[both exhale]

189
00:10:19,285 --> 00:10:22,496
[Riri] Anzu, will you please
give me back my wand?

190
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:24,290
There's no way, Riri!

191
00:10:24,373 --> 00:10:26,584
I think I'll put it
in my blender and puree it.

192
00:10:26,667 --> 00:10:28,085
No. Please, don't.

193
00:10:28,169 --> 00:10:31,213
If you want it back,
you'll have to get down on your knees

194
00:10:31,297 --> 00:10:34,717
and beg for it.
Then go right back to your planet.

195
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,344
Uh…

196
00:10:36,427 --> 00:10:38,721
You really are an Anti-Heroine.

197
00:10:39,764 --> 00:10:40,973
Uh, it's fine.

198
00:10:41,057 --> 00:10:43,643
I can just reorder it
and have it delivered.

199
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:47,772
Now, I've caught you off guard!
[yells]

200
00:10:47,855 --> 00:10:48,856
[gasps]

201
00:10:48,939 --> 00:10:50,149
[both grunt]

202
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:51,484
Huh!

203
00:10:51,567 --> 00:10:52,485
[gasps]

204
00:11:01,577 --> 00:11:03,496
[shrieks]

205
00:11:03,579 --> 00:11:04,747
Oh, man.

206
00:11:05,331 --> 00:11:07,833
[groans]
If the wand gets contaminated,

207
00:11:07,917 --> 00:11:11,003
I can't use it again
until it gets purified.

208
00:11:12,088 --> 00:11:15,007
Oh, really? Well, that's disappointing.

209
00:11:15,091 --> 00:11:17,009
-[water running]
-[dishes clanking]

210
00:11:22,098 --> 00:11:24,892
[Tsukasa] By the way,
you have nothing to worry about.

211
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:26,977
Huh, what do you mean?

212
00:11:27,645 --> 00:11:31,315
You might have heard this from Hoshino,
but I'm not interested in dating.

213
00:11:32,316 --> 00:11:36,237
You must be worried that some strange guy
is staying with the girl you like.

214
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,696
-[plate shatters]
-Huh?

215
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,198
[Junta gasps]

216
00:11:39,281 --> 00:11:40,116
I got it.

217
00:11:40,199 --> 00:11:42,076
[Junta] Why would you say
something like that?

218
00:11:42,827 --> 00:11:44,203
The girl I like…

219
00:11:44,954 --> 00:11:46,330
[Tsukasa] Well, it's true, right?

220
00:11:46,414 --> 00:11:47,248
[gasps]

221
00:11:47,832 --> 00:11:50,793
No way! Is it really that obvious?

222
00:11:50,876 --> 00:11:53,337
And wait, does Anzu know about it too?

223
00:11:53,421 --> 00:11:56,257
I don't think so. She's kind of oblivious.

224
00:11:57,550 --> 00:12:01,011
That's why there's no way
I'd fall for her, so don't worry.

225
00:12:01,637 --> 00:12:04,056
You think Anzu has nothing to offer?

226
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:05,599
No, that wasn't my point.

227
00:12:06,475 --> 00:12:07,560
Listen…

228
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:11,313
You don't have to worry about it.
Hoshino only likes me as a friend too.

229
00:12:11,981 --> 00:12:15,317
[Junta] Kazuki, you don't need
to worry about my feelings.

230
00:12:16,652 --> 00:12:18,571
It's not like I even really have a say.

231
00:12:19,321 --> 00:12:21,115
As long as Anzu's happy,

232
00:12:23,451 --> 00:12:24,493
then so am I.

233
00:12:25,202 --> 00:12:28,080
I just have to try to keep up with her.

234
00:12:28,747 --> 00:12:32,668
Jeez, why the heck
am I telling you all of this stuff?

235
00:12:32,751 --> 00:12:33,752
Seriously.

236
00:12:34,712 --> 00:12:35,880
We're back.

237
00:12:36,464 --> 00:12:38,132
-We got all sorts of ice cream…
-[wails]

238
00:12:38,215 --> 00:12:39,758
…so let's dig in.

239
00:12:40,342 --> 00:12:42,636
Sorry, Anzu, I broke a plate.

240
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,722
[Anzu] What? Are you okay?

241
00:12:44,805 --> 00:12:45,723
[Junta] Yeah.

242
00:12:45,806 --> 00:12:48,726
[Riri sobs]
Boo-hoo-hoo. My poor wand.

243
00:12:48,809 --> 00:12:50,811
[mellow music]

244
00:12:55,983 --> 00:12:57,234
Dinner was great, thanks.

245
00:12:57,318 --> 00:12:58,319
Mm-hm.

246
00:12:58,402 --> 00:13:01,113
Well, Kazuki's the one
who made most of the food.

247
00:13:01,197 --> 00:13:02,907
The ice cream was good too.

248
00:13:02,990 --> 00:13:05,493
Thank you,
but I just bought them at the store.

249
00:13:05,576 --> 00:13:07,244
[chuckles]

250
00:13:07,995 --> 00:13:10,039
[Junta] Can I come for dinner again?

251
00:13:10,122 --> 00:13:11,832
[Anzu] Huh? Of course.

252
00:13:12,833 --> 00:13:15,628
Okay, I think I'm actually gonna run home.

253
00:13:15,711 --> 00:13:17,880
Amazing. Be safe.

254
00:13:17,963 --> 00:13:19,256
I will. See ya.

255
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:24,220
[Anzu sighs]
I'm so exhausted.

256
00:13:25,221 --> 00:13:27,139
But it looks like I survived another day.

257
00:13:29,475 --> 00:13:33,145
Hey, Kazuki. Thanks for doing
all that at the last minute.

258
00:13:33,229 --> 00:13:34,605
[Tsukasa] Huh? Uh, sure.

259
00:13:36,899 --> 00:13:40,611
It's been a while
since I've had such a lively dinner.

260
00:13:42,154 --> 00:13:44,782
That's right. You live alone, don't you?

261
00:13:46,867 --> 00:13:47,701
[Tsukasa] Yeah.

262
00:13:50,538 --> 00:13:54,333
[Anzu] Now that I think about it,
maybe there's a good reason that

263
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,835
he lives all by himself.

264
00:13:58,087 --> 00:14:01,590
There are tons of complicated
family situations out there.

265
00:14:01,674 --> 00:14:04,051
It's probably not polite
for me to ask him.

266
00:14:07,137 --> 00:14:09,807
I'm sure he's going
to tell me about it someday.

267
00:14:12,476 --> 00:14:14,019
[birds chirping]

268
00:14:15,479 --> 00:14:16,814
-[clattering]
-[sleepy groan]

269
00:14:19,441 --> 00:14:20,359
What's that?

270
00:14:24,238 --> 00:14:25,906
-[clattering continues]
-Hm?

271
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,324
[Riri grunting]

272
00:14:28,742 --> 00:14:29,618
Uh-oh.

273
00:14:30,953 --> 00:14:33,122
-[grunts, groans]
-What the heck are you doing?

274
00:14:33,205 --> 00:14:36,083
What were you gonna do
with my beloved treasures?

275
00:14:36,166 --> 00:14:39,044
Huh? What is this? Revenge from yesterday?

276
00:14:39,128 --> 00:14:41,297
[both grunt]

277
00:14:45,509 --> 00:14:47,052
-Bye!
-[Anzu] Hey!

278
00:14:47,136 --> 00:14:48,721
-Wait… Ugh…
-[grunts]

279
00:14:49,638 --> 00:14:51,265
Oh, I, um…

280
00:14:51,932 --> 00:14:54,268
There was a bug. Morning.

281
00:14:57,938 --> 00:14:59,481
-Nice hair.
-[shrieks]

282
00:15:00,232 --> 00:15:02,234
[bright music]

283
00:15:06,196 --> 00:15:07,990
Where's your old friend today?

284
00:15:08,073 --> 00:15:09,617
[Anzu] He's got morning practice.

285
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:10,701
Gotcha.

286
00:15:14,496 --> 00:15:18,167
Oh, hey, you think it's cool
to walk to school together?

287
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:21,378
No one else from school lives
around here. It should be fine.

288
00:15:21,462 --> 00:15:22,296
All right.

289
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,008
[indistinct laughter]

290
00:15:27,885 --> 00:15:29,720
[sighs]
I'm starving.

291
00:15:29,803 --> 00:15:31,639
I can't wait for lunch.

292
00:15:32,222 --> 00:15:33,891
Don't get caught eating early again.

293
00:15:34,475 --> 00:15:36,226
-[Anzu] Where's Makoto today?
-Hm?

294
00:15:36,310 --> 00:15:37,978
-[Tsukasa] He slept in.
-[Anzu laughs]

295
00:15:38,979 --> 00:15:40,022
[Anzu] Is he gonna make it?

296
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:41,482
-I'm sure he will.
-[boy 1] Oh, hey!

297
00:15:41,565 --> 00:15:43,609
Isn't that your old friend, Junta?

298
00:15:43,692 --> 00:15:44,693
[Junta gasps]

299
00:15:44,777 --> 00:15:46,946
[boy 2] Hm? She's with Kazuki, dude.

300
00:15:47,529 --> 00:15:50,950
-This is bad, man. The girls love him.
-Yeah? Hey! What?

301
00:15:51,533 --> 00:15:53,035
Junta, what's up?

302
00:15:53,118 --> 00:15:54,036
[Junta] Good morning.

303
00:15:54,536 --> 00:15:56,288
You're working hard, huh?

304
00:15:56,372 --> 00:15:57,623
[chuckles]

305
00:15:58,540 --> 00:15:59,625
[gasps]

306
00:15:59,708 --> 00:16:00,542
Yep.

307
00:16:01,543 --> 00:16:03,462
Are those two together, then?

308
00:16:03,545 --> 00:16:06,131
No, they just live
in the same neighborhood.

309
00:16:06,215 --> 00:16:08,968
So, that's why you were
asking about him yesterday.

310
00:16:09,051 --> 00:16:10,719
No, it's not like that.

311
00:16:13,263 --> 00:16:16,225
Hey, Anzu, when did you
and Kazuki become friends?

312
00:16:17,142 --> 00:16:18,686
Oh, I, uh…

313
00:16:19,269 --> 00:16:20,854
You walked to school with him.

314
00:16:20,938 --> 00:16:22,523
I'm dying to know,

315
00:16:22,606 --> 00:16:25,442
because he seems like
the type who's not into girls.

316
00:16:25,526 --> 00:16:29,530
Oh, no, uh, we just live
really close to each other. That's all.

317
00:16:29,613 --> 00:16:31,532
[Anzu] Sorry, I can't tell you anything.

318
00:16:31,615 --> 00:16:34,159
-Oh, my gosh, that is, like, so unfair!
-Oh, my gosh, that is, like, so unfair!

319
00:16:34,743 --> 00:16:36,996
Yeah, Kazuki and I
are really just friends.

320
00:16:37,079 --> 00:16:38,539
-Really?
-That's it?

321
00:16:39,748 --> 00:16:40,624
[Anzu] Y-- Yeah…

322
00:16:43,252 --> 00:16:44,545
Okey dokey.

323
00:16:44,628 --> 00:16:47,798
Well, I have to say
this is very exciting for me.

324
00:16:47,881 --> 00:16:50,634
You're finally
in a romantic comedy situation

325
00:16:50,718 --> 00:16:52,302
for the first time ever.

326
00:16:52,386 --> 00:16:54,388
[Anzu] Saki, you are correct.

327
00:16:54,471 --> 00:16:56,890
No. I'm so jealous.

328
00:16:56,974 --> 00:16:59,018
You can't hog them all, okay?

329
00:16:59,101 --> 00:17:00,436
[moans]

330
00:17:01,103 --> 00:17:02,896
Oh, yeah, how's living alone?

331
00:17:03,647 --> 00:17:05,607
We should have a sleepover soon.

332
00:17:05,691 --> 00:17:06,942
[girls] I'm so in!

333
00:17:07,026 --> 00:17:09,403
-[giggling]
-Yeah, let's do it.

334
00:17:09,486 --> 00:17:11,405
[lively music]

335
00:17:23,042 --> 00:17:24,293
[yawns]

336
00:17:24,376 --> 00:17:25,586
I'm so sleepy.

337
00:17:27,087 --> 00:17:29,465
Since Kazuki has work tonight,

338
00:17:29,548 --> 00:17:32,217
I'm alone as long as Riri doesn't show up.

339
00:17:34,136 --> 00:17:35,471
[sighs]

340
00:17:38,015 --> 00:17:39,433
[cries]

341
00:17:39,516 --> 00:17:41,393
Damn it! I'm sleepy but I want a game!

342
00:17:41,477 --> 00:17:43,062
I want chocolate!

343
00:17:43,145 --> 00:17:45,105
And Momohiki!

344
00:17:45,189 --> 00:17:47,107
I'll distract myself with a nap.

345
00:17:47,858 --> 00:17:50,110
Momohiki…

346
00:17:50,194 --> 00:17:52,029
-[door opens]
-[Junta] I'm home.

347
00:17:53,405 --> 00:17:55,866
-[brother] You're back, Junta!
-[laughter]

348
00:17:57,326 --> 00:17:58,660
[brother] You're sweaty!

349
00:17:58,744 --> 00:18:00,829
What did you say? Ah, take this!

350
00:18:00,913 --> 00:18:03,457
Junta, hon, could you drop this off
at Anzu's house

351
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:06,168
right after you take your bath?
It's nikujaga.

352
00:18:07,002 --> 00:18:10,047
What? Again? Isn't it late?

353
00:18:10,130 --> 00:18:12,925
[Junta's mom] It's all right.
She can eat it tomorrow.

354
00:18:13,634 --> 00:18:16,637
-[giggles]
-[brother] But, Mom, he's just got back!

355
00:18:17,805 --> 00:18:18,806
[door opens]

356
00:18:20,849 --> 00:18:21,767
[snores]

357
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:25,813
[moans]

358
00:18:26,939 --> 00:18:29,525
It's dark. Guess I must have overslept.

359
00:18:29,608 --> 00:18:31,985
-[footsteps in distance]
-Hm? Huh?

360
00:18:32,069 --> 00:18:33,987
Is Kazuki back from work already?

361
00:18:36,824 --> 00:18:39,451
Hm, it's too soon for him to be back.

362
00:18:39,952 --> 00:18:43,413
So that means that thing is here again.

363
00:18:43,497 --> 00:18:44,456
[laughs]

364
00:18:44,957 --> 00:18:46,208
-[quick footsteps]
-[grunts]

365
00:18:48,794 --> 00:18:52,589
Hey, you! I'll smash your head in,
you bastard!

366
00:18:52,673 --> 00:18:53,799
[gasps]

367
00:18:56,176 --> 00:18:58,804
-[Anzu] An underwear thief?
-[thief breathing shakily]

368
00:18:58,887 --> 00:19:01,515
What? You ignore the teen girl's room

369
00:19:01,598 --> 00:19:04,143
-and steal the mom underwear!
-[thief yells]

370
00:19:04,685 --> 00:19:07,062
[exhales]
Okay now, why did I say that?

371
00:19:07,563 --> 00:19:09,606
-Huh? He's running!
-[thief grunts]

372
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:11,942
[action music]

373
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:14,778
-[Junta] I wonder if she's home.
-[thuds]

374
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:15,946
[leaves rustling]

375
00:19:16,655 --> 00:19:17,990
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

376
00:19:25,706 --> 00:19:28,083
[Anzu screams]
Stop!

377
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:29,209
Hey Junta!

378
00:19:29,293 --> 00:19:30,294
[Junta] Who was that guy?

379
00:19:30,377 --> 00:19:32,087
-An underwear thief!
-[Junta] What?

380
00:19:32,171 --> 00:19:34,673
Ugh, he's escaping! I need a cop.

381
00:19:36,758 --> 00:19:38,093
[pants]

382
00:19:38,177 --> 00:19:39,678
What? Junta?

383
00:19:41,221 --> 00:19:42,389
Is he gonna be okay?

384
00:19:43,265 --> 00:19:45,184
[pants]

385
00:19:47,811 --> 00:19:48,729
[grunts]

386
00:19:49,313 --> 00:19:50,230
Don't move!

387
00:19:51,315 --> 00:19:52,691
-[thief groans]
-[pants]

388
00:19:54,693 --> 00:19:57,738
Hey, there they are! Officer, right there!

389
00:19:59,198 --> 00:20:00,240
[screams]

390
00:20:03,827 --> 00:20:05,245
[wails]

391
00:20:05,329 --> 00:20:06,205
Huh?

392
00:20:07,956 --> 00:20:09,833
So, after all of that…

393
00:20:09,917 --> 00:20:12,085
[Anzu] Jeez. It's already so late.

394
00:20:12,169 --> 00:20:15,547
I'm sorry you came to bring me food
and got wrapped up in that whole mess.

395
00:20:15,631 --> 00:20:16,548
[Junta] It's all good.

396
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:20,052
But you, you really saved me, Junta.

397
00:20:20,135 --> 00:20:21,762
You're faster than lightning.

398
00:20:21,845 --> 00:20:23,513
-That thief had terrible luck.
-[laughs]

399
00:20:24,097 --> 00:20:26,600
I'm glad the police was able
to get here right away, too.

400
00:20:26,683 --> 00:20:27,517
[Anzu] Mm-hm.

401
00:20:28,227 --> 00:20:31,939
Ah, I forgot I just woke up
from a nap. Is my hair a disaster?

402
00:20:32,022 --> 00:20:33,815
[Junta] What? No, not at all.

403
00:20:34,483 --> 00:20:35,525
It's really cu--

404
00:20:36,026 --> 00:20:37,486
Uh, it's really?

405
00:20:38,987 --> 00:20:40,781
Normal! It's totally normal!

406
00:20:40,864 --> 00:20:42,532
[laughs]
That's good.

407
00:20:42,616 --> 00:20:44,660
My hair kind of explodes when I sleep.

408
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:49,706
I'm jealous of Saki's hair.
I wish I had hair like hers.

409
00:20:50,290 --> 00:20:52,709
[Junta] Hey, listen.
I'm really glad nothing happened.

410
00:20:53,669 --> 00:20:56,296
If anything happened to you, I…

411
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:58,382
[romantic music]

412
00:21:01,802 --> 00:21:02,678
Hm?

413
00:21:03,595 --> 00:21:05,180
I'll just run to the store.

414
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:07,891
-You don't have to!
-You've got it all wrong.

415
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:09,893
An underwear thief?

416
00:21:09,977 --> 00:21:10,811
Yeah.

417
00:21:11,353 --> 00:21:13,855
Well, it's a good thing
the guy didn't try to attack you.

418
00:21:14,356 --> 00:21:16,483
There are plenty of nut cases out there.

419
00:21:16,566 --> 00:21:18,443
Well, apparently.

420
00:21:19,528 --> 00:21:23,407
But I think the thief was probably
more scared of me then I was of him.

421
00:21:24,533 --> 00:21:27,619
Does that mean you said
something to threaten him, then?

422
00:21:30,664 --> 00:21:32,958
[Tsukasa chuckles]
My bad, I know it's messed up.

423
00:21:33,041 --> 00:21:34,501
[Anzu] You think this is funny?

424
00:21:34,584 --> 00:21:36,253
[phone vibrates]

425
00:21:38,380 --> 00:21:39,965
Oh, my mom.

426
00:21:40,048 --> 00:21:41,800
-I got to take this.
-Of course.

427
00:21:42,759 --> 00:21:43,969
-[Junta] Mom…
-Oh, hey,

428
00:21:44,052 --> 00:21:46,555
did you finish work
early today or something?

429
00:21:46,638 --> 00:21:48,515
It was slow so they sent me home.

430
00:21:48,598 --> 00:21:49,433
[Anzu] Oh, gotcha.

431
00:21:49,933 --> 00:21:53,228
By the way,
since the bedroom window's broken,

432
00:21:53,312 --> 00:21:55,397
could you sleep on the couch tonight?

433
00:21:56,106 --> 00:22:00,027
Well, as long as someone doesn't
fall asleep holding me down,

434
00:22:00,110 --> 00:22:01,320
we're cool.

435
00:22:01,903 --> 00:22:02,946
Huh?

436
00:22:04,406 --> 00:22:05,615
Hm…

437
00:22:05,699 --> 00:22:07,117
[exclaims]

438
00:22:07,868 --> 00:22:11,788
[grunts]
Well, I am actually very sorry I did that.

439
00:22:11,872 --> 00:22:14,124
[Junta] What? Well, wait a minute!

440
00:22:14,207 --> 00:22:16,168
-I mean that's a little…
-Huh?

441
00:22:16,251 --> 00:22:18,170
[Junta] Oh, okay, fine.
I'll give her the phone.

442
00:22:19,171 --> 00:22:22,090
Sorry about this, my mom wants to talk.

443
00:22:23,091 --> 00:22:24,760
Huh? Sure.

444
00:22:26,261 --> 00:22:29,431
-Hello?
-[Junta's mom] Anzu, it's been a while.

445
00:22:29,514 --> 00:22:31,600
I heard about what happened.

446
00:22:31,683 --> 00:22:32,893
Oh, it's fine.

447
00:22:32,976 --> 00:22:34,895
[Junta's mom]
That must have been so scary.

448
00:22:34,978 --> 00:22:36,605
Oh, well, yeah.

449
00:22:36,688 --> 00:22:38,523
[Junta's mom]
I'm so worried about you, sweetie.

450
00:22:38,607 --> 00:22:40,067
You must be scared all by yourself.

451
00:22:40,150 --> 00:22:42,360
You should have
a bodyguard, don't you think?

452
00:22:43,653 --> 00:22:44,529
What now?

453
00:22:44,613 --> 00:22:47,074
[Junta's mom] It's too dangerous
for a girl to live alone.

454
00:22:47,157 --> 00:22:50,035
-I'll lend you Junta for a while.
-[Anzu grunts]

455
00:22:50,118 --> 00:22:53,497
Look, our place is beyond cramped
with all my boys,

456
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:55,457
and it's just a total mess.

457
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:57,584
Use him all you want. I'll let Miyo know.

458
00:22:57,667 --> 00:22:58,668
[Anzu] My mom?

459
00:22:58,752 --> 00:23:01,129
[Junta's mom]
Oh, I'm sorry. The baby is crying.

460
00:23:01,213 --> 00:23:02,881
I'll talk to you later, okay?

461
00:23:03,673 --> 00:23:07,302
[Anzu groans]
Hm, this forced scenario…

462
00:23:07,385 --> 00:23:09,679
I'm having mad deja vu right now?

463
00:23:09,763 --> 00:23:12,599
[Riri] Ding, ding, ding, ding, ding, ding.

464
00:23:12,682 --> 00:23:14,101
[Anzu] I knew it!

465
00:23:14,184 --> 00:23:17,562
So that means… Uh, no, no way!

466
00:23:17,646 --> 00:23:20,607
All three of us will be living together?

467
00:23:20,690 --> 00:23:23,110
-Please, be delicious.
-All right, this one's next.

468
00:23:23,193 --> 00:23:24,694
-Listen to this.
-Oh, what happened?

469
00:23:24,778 --> 00:23:25,612
[all laugh]

470
00:23:25,695 --> 00:23:28,615
-Why!
-Yes!

471
00:23:29,616 --> 00:23:31,284
A fanfare, please!

472
00:23:31,368 --> 00:23:33,370
And a big congratulations!

473
00:23:33,453 --> 00:23:35,747
Did you fall for my little trick?

474
00:23:35,831 --> 00:23:38,792
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

475
00:23:38,875 --> 00:23:42,546
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

476
00:23:42,629 --> 00:23:45,298
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

477
00:23:45,382 --> 00:23:47,676
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

478
00:23:47,759 --> 00:23:50,345
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

479
00:23:50,428 --> 00:23:52,347
So I can make sure I get paid.

480
00:23:52,430 --> 00:23:54,599
[closing theme music]

481
00:23:54,683 --> 00:23:55,517
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

482
00:23:58,145 --> 00:23:58,979
♪ Let's go! ♪

483
00:24:01,523 --> 00:24:02,649
♪ Lo-love! ♪

484
00:24:04,734 --> 00:24:05,569
♪ Here we go! ♪
